WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.269
The map tools control how you view, compare and measure the basin.

00:00:07.254 --> 00:00:13.568
Map Settings switches between 3D terrain, 3D smooth and flat 2D.

00:00:14.224 --> 00:00:22.408
Choose a basemap here: satellite imagery, streets, topographic, light or dark.

00:00:23.076 --> 00:00:26.480
Click Map Settings again to close it.

00:00:27.145 --> 00:00:34.293
Drag the compass ring to rotate, the inner gyroscope to tilt, and double click to reset.

00:00:34.954 --> 00:00:39.128
Zoom in and out, or return to the home view.

00:00:39.785 --> 00:00:44.814
Compare shows two layers side by side with a draggable divider.

00:00:45.476 --> 00:00:49.245
Pedestrian mode gives a street level view.

00:00:49.906 --> 00:00:54.845
And the measure tool reports distances between points on the map.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:01:01.013
Those are the map tools. The guide below covers each one.
